<title>USA: No significant cold seen in Brazil coffee belt - WSC.</title>
<headline>No significant cold seen in Brazil coffee belt - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>No damaging cold is expected through the coming weekend in Brazil's coffee-growing areas, independent forecaster Weather Services Corporation (WSC) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Lows on Wednesday will be mostly 50-58F, with the outlook for near- to above-normal temperatures.</p>
